  actor "Client" as client
  actor "Financial Advisor (FA)" as fa
  actor "System Administrator (SA)" as sa
  
  
  client --> CFR001 : View financial insights dashboard
  client --> CFR002 : Receive alerts on anomalous transactions
  client --> CFR003 : View financial predictions based on data and trends
  client --> CFR004 : Personalized recommendations aligned with profile
  client --> CFR005 : Manage preferences for personalized recs
  client --> CFR006 : View spending limit alerts when exceeding thresholds
  client --> CFR007 : Access investment opportunities suitable to risk profile (MiFID II)
  client --> CFR008 : Receive news related to portfolio
  client --> CFR009 : Consolidated personalized dashboard for monitoring
  client --> CFR010 : Manage relationship with financial advisors, including data sharing

  fa --> FAFR002 : View client intervention alerts (proactive assistance)
  fa --> FAFR003 : View predictive analytics about clients' situations during consultations
  sa --> SAFR001 : Configure analysis parameters for compliance and accuracy
  
  
  SystemAdmin <|-- SA: manages system settings

  Sys --> CFR002 : Deliver alerts through channels (SFR)
  Sys --> CFR004 : Generate personalized recommendations (AIFR)
  Sys --> CFR005 : Manage preferences via AI
  Sys --> CFR006 : Send spending limit alerts when thresholds exceeded (AIFR)
  Sys --> CFR007 : Find investment opportunities based on risk profile and ESG (AIFR)
  Sys --> CFR008 : Request anomaly transaction alerts for AML compliance (AIFR)
  Sys --> SFR013: Track client progress and goals
  Sys --> SFR014: Maintain historical record of insights

  
  SystemAdmin -> SA : Manage system parameters
  
